**********************************************************************
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
*      REAL TIME DELTA SUBROUTINE                                    *J
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
**********************************************************************

* FUNCTION   THE PURPOSE OF THE REAL TIME DELTA SUBROUTINE IS TO
*            PROVIDE A CURRENT VALUE OF REAL TIME AND A DELTA TIME
*            VALUE. THE DELTA TIME IS THE DIFFERENCE BETWEEN THE
*            CURRENT TIME AND THE LAST VALUE OF REAL TIME THAT WAS
*            READ IN THIS SUBROUTINE.

* ENTRIES    RTS      ENTERED TO READ REAL AND DELTA TIME

       ORG     INTP,D.DATA

OLDT   BSS     1

RTS    STO     777          SAVE RETURN HOP CONSTANT                  B

       CLA     775          OBT PREV DET VALUE OF REAL TIME FROM      B
       STO     OLDT         PQ VALUE                                  B

       PIO     103          OBTAIN CURRENT VALUE OF REAL TIME AND     I
*                           FORM DELTA TM.                            I

       STO     775          PUT CURRENT REAL TIME IN PQ REGISTER      B

       SUB     OLDT         PUT DELTA TIME IN ACCUMULATOR             B
       AND     D.KSY0

       HOP     777          EXIT HOP TO CR                            X
